A geometric analysis of Chopin's Prelude No. 4 using 3D topology</strong></a> <code class=\"notranslate\">github.com</code> <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47088005\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">comments</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tuananh.net/2026/02/20/patch-is-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>A bug is a bug, but a patch is a policy: The case for bootable containers</strong></a> <code class=\"notranslate\">tuananh.net</code> <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47086900\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">comments</code></a></li>\n</ol>",
