            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121730168?u=cd0f66f893ae218bd4bca3b8659c6248af2ba26c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The date icon is off by 1 day.<br>\nI think it using the server date instead of local date from obsidian.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The US time is not correct.  It looks like a time in Asia region.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Can it use something like:<br>\n<a href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2018/02/this-svg-always-shows-todays-date/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2018/02/this-svg-always-shows-todays-date/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With the SVG to CSS conversion.</p>",
